# Directory listing so MetronomeCore can be a singleton. The bar instantiates
# one widget per monitor; without a shared singleton each of those would spawn
# its own engine and the machine would beat three times over.
singleton MetronomeCore 1.0 MetronomeCore.qml
TempoDial 1.0 TempoDial.qml
Wordmark 1.0 Wordmark.qml
